---
import Layout from "../layouts/Post.astro";
---

<Layout
	title="About Us"
	description="About Firelands Core Project"
	pubDate={new Date("September 11 2023")}
>
    <div class="about-container">
        <section class="mission">
            <div class="mission-content">
                <h2>Our Mission</h2>
                <p>
                    Firelands Core Project is an open-source community dedicated to developing a high-fidelity emulator for <strong>World of Warcraft: Cataclysm (v4.3.4)</strong>. 
                    Founded with an educational purpose, we believe in the power of collaborative learning and the preservation of gaming history.
                </p>
                <div class="glow-divider"></div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <div class="features-grid">
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="icon">🎓</div>
                <h3>Educational</h3>
                <p>Designed as a learning platform for software architecture, reverse engineering, and database management.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="icon">🤝</div>
                <h3>Community Driven</h3>
                <p>We believe the best core is built by many hands. Everyone is welcome to contribute, regardless of skill level.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="icon">🔥</div>
                <h3>Performance</h3>
                <p>Optimized for modern hardware, focusing on stability and high concurrency for the best player experience.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="icon">⚖️</div>
                <h3>Open Source</h3>
                <p>Our code is and will always be open. Transparency and freedom are at the heart of our development.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <section class="long-content">
            <h3>Our Journey</h3>
            <p>
                The Firelands Core Project started as a small group of enthusiasts who wanted to explore the complexities of the Cataclysm expansion. 
                Over time, it has evolved into a robust ecosystem where developers from around the world share their knowledge.
            </p>
            <blockquote>
                "To make the best emulator, we don't just need code; we need a community that values learning above all else."
            </blockquote>
            <p>
                Our intention is to create a community in which people can participate, learn, study, and contribute. 
                Whether you are a seasoned C++ developer or just starting your journey into SQL, there is a place for you in the Firelands.
            </p>
        </section>
    </div>

    <style>
        .about-container {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 4rem;
            animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease-out;
            position: relative;
        }

        @keyframes fadeInUp {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(20px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        .about-container::before {
            content: 'FIRELANDS';
            position: absolute;
            top: -20px;
            right: -20px;
            font-size: 8rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: rgba(var(--accent), 0.03);
            z-index: -1;
            pointer-events: none;
            font-family: 'Metamorphous', serif;
        }

        .mission {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem 0;
        }

        .mission h2 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgb(var(--gold)), rgb(var(--accent)));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            text-shadow: none;
        }

        .mission p {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            color: rgb(var(--gray-dark));
            line-height: 1.8;
        }


        .features-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
            margin: 2rem 0;
        }

        .feature-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            border: 1px solid rgba(var(--accent), 0.1);
            padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
            border-radius: 16px;
            transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .feature-card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(var(--accent), 0.1), transparent);
            opacity: 0;
            transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
        }

        .feature-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            border-color: rgba(var(--accent), 0.4);
            background: rgba(var(--accent), 0.05);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }

        .feature-card:hover::before {
            opacity: 1;
        }

        .feature-card .icon {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            display: block;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .feature-card:hover .icon {
            transform: scale(1.2) rotate(5deg);
            filter: drop-shadow(0 0 10px rgba(var(--accent), 0.5));
        }

        .feature-card h3 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: rgb(var(--gold));
        }

        .feature-card p {
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: rgb(var(--gray));
            margin: 0;
        }

        .glow-divider {
            height: 2px;
            width: 200px;
            margin: 3rem auto 0;
            background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, rgb(var(--accent)), transparent);
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(var(--accent), 0.5);
            position: relative;
        }

        .glow-divider::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            width: 10px;
            height: 10px;
            background: rgb(var(--gold));
            border-radius: 50%;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgb(var(--gold));
        }

        .long-content {
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            padding: 3rem;
            border-radius: 20px;
            border-left: 4px solid rgb(var(--accent));
        }

        .long-content h3 {
            margin-top: 0;
        }

        @media (max-width: 720px) {
            .mission h2 {
                font-size: 2.2rem;
            }
            .long-content {
                padding: 1.5rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</Layout>
